23117062001", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400237_1181323123728667_4048859949131775265_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YSr_fledZr8Q7kNvwHJ7QJG&_nc_oc=Adk8vZPUa0d4ZAkTH1LiH4ObTNvUzuYe8Uu61NpzUJggboMjgbPrc2r-QzcDxkqlwGk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw671X8_anNeGySCf7Nv_3x58fLgBEIom4gM5naPma4uQ&oe=69B54F7F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Fear Killers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This game is a fun and scary game ever way you go there might be a monster A Lot Fun But can you Stand It? Welp Lets See !\ud83d\udc7b Lets Be Nice And Help Others With the game! This Is the beta So if you have problem Join The Discord And Send Feed Back With Anything that Looks Wrong We Have Our Direct Message Open! And Remember Be Nice Too Others They Need Help Too !!! We Don't allow Rude People So If you are being toxic Then You Will Get banned. there are 1 level So Far But More Soon ! . In Fear Killers We Want The best For Our Community Don't Fear ( get it ) Too Direct Message Us !", "short_description": "Fear killers Is a gorilla tag fan game you can play with your friends and meet new friends using photon and play fab so you can buy cosmetics this game is scary can you beat it ? \ud83d\ude01 remember Have Fun! Screams And Laughs \nAre You Sure You fully ready\ud83d\ude01"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/98ba69e8-6683-41f4-9967-90abf422f09b", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ShinobiVr", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://gorilla-runners-privacy-terms.my.canva.site/more-web-sites", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subsc